he criminals.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">English Translation - Noor International Center — v1.1.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">The words of the two imams are given in their original Arabic, verbatim, with references.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><h3>What he quoted from others</h3><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\"><span class=\"who\">الحسن البصري وغيره</span> <span class=\"st\">حكاه</span> «الشرك والتكذيب»<cite>«طريق الهجرتين وباب السعادتين» 1/68</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=en#s26a200\">Open in the interactive tafsir (full texts)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/en/ayah/26-196.html\">Previous verse (26:196)</a><a href=\"/en/ayah/26-211.html\">Next verse (26:211)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsir al-Shaykhayn · <a href=\"/en/\">Home</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">About the project</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Privacy &amp; terms</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/26-211.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsir of Ash-Shu&#x27;araa 26:211 — by Ibn Taymiyyah and Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"It is not allowable for them, nor would they be able.\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/26-211.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-211.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/26-211.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/26-211.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ur\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ur/ayah/26-211.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"id\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/id/ayah